WEBVTT

01:30.200 --> 01:34.940
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.170 --> 01:37.860
[Episode 31]

01:38.020 --> 01:38.570
Hong Ye,

01:39.330 --> 01:40.950
you thought sealing us away
for 10,000 years

01:40.950 --> 01:42.840
would allow you to seize power alone?

01:42.840 --> 01:44.640
Today, I'll show you what it feels like

01:44.640 --> 01:45.820
to die 1,000 deaths.

01:47.280 --> 01:49.180
I'd like to peel off his skin,

01:49.490 --> 01:50.890
stuff it with his hair,

01:51.120 --> 01:52.479
and make it a ball to play with.
Sounds good?

01:52.479 --> 01:53.680
That's too merciful.

01:55.310 --> 01:57.370
I want to strip the flesh from his body

01:57.710 --> 01:59.280
piece by piece,

02:00.070 --> 02:02.130
each slice as thin as a cicada's wing.

02:02.560 --> 02:03.890
Both of you, stand down.

02:04.150 --> 02:05.710
Just watch.

02:05.950 --> 02:06.510
Ao Hen!

02:07.150 --> 02:08.400
We all suffered the seal for 10,000 years.

02:08.400 --> 02:09.680
What right do you have to act alone?

02:09.680 --> 02:10.190
Shut up.

02:36.590 --> 02:37.750
Redirect the formation

02:37.750 --> 02:39.430
to focus the attack 15 miles southwest.

02:39.430 --> 02:40.690
Change the formation!

02:58.610 --> 02:59.730
Die in battle,

03:00.070 --> 03:03.600
and at least your family will
receive compensation to live off.

03:03.630 --> 03:06.290
But desertion is
defying His Majesty's orders.

03:07.260 --> 03:09.060
You will be killed with no mercy.

03:18.010 --> 03:18.780
Ao Hen,

03:18.920 --> 03:19.630
here's the thing.

03:19.630 --> 03:20.760
You hit way too hard.

03:20.800 --> 03:21.600
A move of yours

03:21.800 --> 03:22.710
will reduce him to ashes, right?

03:22.710 --> 03:23.370
Let go of me!

03:23.730 --> 03:24.590
We'd better...

03:24.630 --> 03:25.560
I'll be gentler.

03:25.840 --> 03:26.700
Let me go first!

03:27.520 --> 03:29.160
You are even more brutal.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.530
Let me do this.

04:11.940 --> 04:14.820
♪ A thousand years have flowed by ♪

04:16.160 --> 04:18.440
♪ Turning into tears
that brim over my eyes ♪

04:18.560 --> 04:19.810
I've seen everything.

04:19.810 --> 04:22.130
♪ And the moonlight to heal sorrow ♪

04:22.120 --> 04:23.400
And I've experienced everything.

04:23.400 --> 04:26.120
♪ The sweetness of the world
always tastes like the first time ♪

04:26.260 --> 04:28.180
Now I understand your suffering.

04:27.160 --> 04:30.220
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

04:30.120 --> 04:31.830
The agony from the past is
hidden deep down inside.

04:31.390 --> 04:33.900
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

04:33.830 --> 04:35.480
All I want now is you.

04:35.060 --> 04:37.540
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

04:37.200 --> 04:37.870
Xiao Yao.

04:38.710 --> 04:41.070
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

04:40.190 --> 04:42.150
I have been waiting for you all this time.

04:42.150 --> 04:45.080
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

04:45.750 --> 04:46.720
I am Xiao Yao.

04:46.140 --> 04:48.460
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

04:48.800 --> 04:49.800
And I am also Ning'an.

04:49.500 --> 04:52.700
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

04:51.850 --> 04:52.980
It's always been me.

04:53.820 --> 04:56.210
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

04:55.750 --> 04:56.430
Hong Ye,

04:57.080 --> 05:00.430
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

04:58.090 --> 04:58.920
I'm sorry.

05:01.330 --> 05:03.730
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

05:03.250 --> 05:05.000
Back then,
I was constrained by circumstances

05:04.690 --> 05:08.000
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

05:06.120 --> 05:07.480
and could not tell you

05:08.560 --> 05:09.720
that my love for you was true.

05:09.250 --> 05:14.290
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

05:12.410 --> 05:15.010
In this life,
I am no longer the human princess.

05:23.320 --> 05:25.780
Your return alone is
the greatest blessing.

05:35.630 --> 05:38.460
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

05:39.670 --> 05:42.170
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

05:41.290 --> 05:42.060
See that?

05:42.820 --> 05:44.000
This woman is human,

05:43.110 --> 05:46.330
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

05:44.570 --> 05:45.830
in league with Hong Ye,

05:46.190 --> 05:47.100
full of tricks.

05:47.700 --> 05:52.670
♪ We forsake three lifetimes of marriage,
only to fulfill our wishes ♪

05:54.270 --> 05:56.670
I've brought back your primordial spirit.

05:58.560 --> 05:59.760
I'll return it to you.

06:13.920 --> 06:17.050
♪ The joys and sorrows in my dreams ♪

06:18.120 --> 06:20.580
♪ Transformed into a farewell song,
stirring the soul ♪

06:21.820 --> 06:24.410
♪ And into wind and rain,
drifting and swirling ♪

06:25.590 --> 06:27.830
♪ The ship of fate
always faces the waves ♪

06:28.910 --> 06:31.840
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my love and hatred ♪

06:32.900 --> 06:35.220
♪ Together, we explore
mountains and rivers with one heart ♪

06:36.260 --> 06:39.460
♪ From now on, someone will share
all my dreams and my drinks ♪

06:40.580 --> 06:42.970
♪ With an extra pair of eyes, we
admire the sun, moon, and stars together ♪

06:43.840 --> 06:47.190
♪ From now on, the moon fears waning,
the waves long for the returning tide ♪

06:48.080 --> 06:50.620
♪ I carry an extra touch of care
in my heart and on my brow ♪

06:51.450 --> 06:54.760
♪ From now on,
with reckless courage and mutual longing ♪

06:56.010 --> 07:01.410
♪ Giving up three lives of marriage
just for ♪

07:05.580 --> 07:07.080
♪ Our wishes ♪

07:16.160 --> 07:17.350
Let go of my sister!

07:30.030 --> 07:30.740
Xiao Yao!

07:31.830 --> 07:32.360
It's you?

07:32.640 --> 07:33.700
What are you doing?

07:34.659 --> 07:35.920
Don't you remember me?

07:36.480 --> 07:37.080
Stay back!

07:38.750 --> 07:40.430
Why is your power weaker than before?

07:40.430 --> 07:41.170
Are you sick?

07:41.190 --> 07:42.120
Let me check on you.

07:42.120 --> 07:42.680
Say whatever you want,

07:42.680 --> 07:43.800
but don't touch me!

07:44.040 --> 07:44.580
Hands off her!

07:44.580 --> 07:46.240
You don't remember anything?

07:47.220 --> 07:48.550
It's been 10,000 years,

07:48.610 --> 07:49.940
and you still don't know

07:49.940 --> 07:51.390
who truly cares for you.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.570
What are you talking about?

07:59.650 --> 08:00.340
Sister!

08:18.300 --> 08:18.830
Xiao Yao,

08:19.120 --> 08:19.630
run!

08:50.390 --> 08:50.990
Hong Ye,

08:51.390 --> 08:52.390
if you dare lay a finger on her,

08:52.390 --> 08:53.780
I swear I will tear you to pieces!

08:53.780 --> 08:55.120
If you try to bewitch her again,

08:55.120 --> 08:56.750
I'll make you die
an even more miserable death!

08:56.750 --> 08:57.750
You despicable rascal!

08:57.750 --> 08:58.810
Stay away from her!

09:00.900 --> 09:02.190
How do they know us?

09:03.430 --> 09:04.700
You know us?

09:04.800 --> 09:05.330
-Mm.
-Mm.

09:06.400 --> 09:07.260
What's my name?

09:07.360 --> 09:08.560
-Xiao Yao.
-Xiao Yao.

09:10.290 --> 09:11.750
Hong Ye just called it out.

09:12.390 --> 09:13.180
Who are you?

09:13.450 --> 09:14.650
I'm Qiong Qi.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.030
I'm your big brother!

09:18.440 --> 09:19.540
Qiong Qi?

09:19.970 --> 09:21.310
My big brother?

09:28.480 --> 09:29.810
Do you remember me then?

09:30.860 --> 09:32.120
Do you remember Ao Hen?

09:33.660 --> 09:35.150
You're Ao Hen?

09:39.030 --> 09:39.630
Sister!

09:40.510 --> 09:41.030
Me...

09:43.900 --> 09:46.270
You couldn't be Teng She, could you?

09:48.080 --> 09:49.600
Sister remembers me! She remembers me!

09:49.600 --> 09:50.770
After 10,000 years,

09:50.910 --> 09:53.130
she only remembers me.

09:56.510 --> 09:57.440
Hold on, hold on.

09:58.200 --> 09:58.750
I

09:58.880 --> 10:00.030
have a poor memory.

10:00.030 --> 10:01.220
I really don't remember

10:01.220 --> 10:02.750
how we met.

10:04.000 --> 10:04.530
Xiao Yao,

10:05.200 --> 10:06.170
it's been 10,000 years.

10:06.170 --> 10:08.080
Who knows how many times
of reincarnation you've had?

10:08.080 --> 10:09.790
It's just normal
that you don't remember clearly.

10:09.790 --> 10:11.590
But she still remembers Hong Ye.

11:03.320 --> 11:04.450
Three great demons,

11:04.760 --> 11:06.670
our demon kind is teetering
on the brink of destruction.

11:06.670 --> 11:08.360
Whatever grievances or grudges you have,

11:08.360 --> 11:09.910
please cast them aside for now.

11:09.910 --> 11:11.250
For nearly 10,000 years,

11:11.250 --> 11:13.420
our demon kind
has been through countless catastrophes,

11:13.420 --> 11:14.820
with few of us remaining.

11:14.910 --> 11:16.220
How dare you say that?

11:17.120 --> 11:17.550
You 3,

11:18.320 --> 11:19.890
you possess such immense power

11:19.890 --> 11:21.750
just to harm your own kind?

11:25.120 --> 11:25.720
Yes.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.390
Of course.

11:31.150 --> 11:32.720
The Demons' Valley beneath your feet is

11:32.720 --> 11:33.960
the only place in this world

11:33.960 --> 11:35.300
for demons to inhabit.

11:35.630 --> 11:36.830
It's in danger now.

11:36.910 --> 11:38.570
It's fine if you don't help us.

11:38.600 --> 11:40.150
But please, at least let us out
to defend it.

11:40.150 --> 11:41.790
Whatever issues you have,
we can discuss them when we return.

11:41.790 --> 11:42.520
Is that okay?

11:44.950 --> 11:47.150
Can't believe demons have become so weak,

11:47.150 --> 11:48.790
being cornered by humans to this extent.

11:48.790 --> 11:50.120
Just some minor humans.

11:50.240 --> 11:50.770
Xiao Yao,

11:51.200 --> 11:52.600
I'll help you solve this.

11:54.840 --> 11:56.200
As long as you ask, Sister,

11:56.200 --> 11:58.840
I'll do anything for you.

12:03.550 --> 12:04.280
Don't worry,

12:04.550 --> 12:05.350
I'm here, too.

12:11.320 --> 12:11.820
Deer!

12:14.910 --> 12:15.790
Bamboo!

12:20.120 --> 12:22.580
Please don't let me be a broom
in my next life!

12:47.080 --> 12:48.010
Don't be afraid.

13:18.000 --> 13:18.910
What are you doing?

13:18.910 --> 13:19.390
Attack!

13:19.820 --> 13:21.520
Such a soft little kitty like you

13:21.520 --> 13:22.920
should be playing with yarn balls

13:22.920 --> 13:24.380
instead of fighting here.

13:25.630 --> 13:26.570
Leave this to me.

14:14.030 --> 14:15.880
Can believe you've been
beaten so badly by humans.

14:15.880 --> 14:16.750
How useless.

14:30.760 --> 14:32.090
Now that's more like it.

15:09.910 --> 15:11.150
Human tactics

15:11.150 --> 15:13.350
have indeed improved quite a bit.

15:24.270 --> 15:24.840
My Lord!

15:24.980 --> 15:25.650
We can't win!

15:25.650 --> 15:26.510
Let's retreat!

15:26.510 --> 15:28.310
If we don't, they'll kill us all!

15:32.270 --> 15:32.870
Fall back.

15:35.670 --> 15:36.200
Go!

15:36.710 --> 15:37.430
Run!

15:37.870 --> 15:38.480
Tan'er,

15:38.620 --> 15:40.420
protect your brother and leave!

15:42.840 --> 15:43.550
Come on!

15:48.020 --> 15:49.750
Don't pursue a cornered enemy.

15:50.150 --> 15:51.950
The humans have grown stronger,

15:52.010 --> 15:53.930
but they're not unbeatable yet.

15:54.200 --> 15:55.580
He was scared off?

15:56.390 --> 15:57.600
But Hong Ye is

15:58.490 --> 15:59.690
really something now

16:01.250 --> 16:02.820
after 10,000 years.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.480
Shut your mouth!

16:06.930 --> 16:09.390
How dare you speak so carelessly
about His Lordship?

16:09.390 --> 16:12.320
Little cat demon,
you're quite protective of your master.

16:12.320 --> 16:14.050
The humans have retreated now.

16:14.390 --> 16:15.270
Take everyone

16:15.270 --> 16:16.320
to a safe place.

16:17.910 --> 16:18.440
Let's go.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.480
Follow me to the Moon-Gazing Terrace.

16:20.480 --> 16:20.910
Mm.

16:24.750 --> 16:26.610
Fortunately, I reacted quickly.

16:26.630 --> 16:27.750
Otherwise, I would've been done for.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.690
Had I not been injured,

16:28.690 --> 16:29.690
this would have been
a piece of cake for me.

16:29.690 --> 16:30.420
Are you okay?

16:30.600 --> 16:31.670
I'm okay. Just some minor wounds.

16:31.670 --> 16:32.270
You doing alright?

16:32.270 --> 16:33.010
Yeah.

16:33.340 --> 16:34.670
How's your injury here?

16:34.760 --> 16:35.220
Come on.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.080
It doesn't hurt anymore.

16:39.080 --> 16:39.830
Thank you.

16:39.870 --> 16:41.440
-Don't worry. I'm fine.
-His Lordship is back.

16:41.440 --> 16:42.840
-My Lord.
-And Xiao Yao is back, too.

16:42.840 --> 16:43.470
Xiao Yao.

16:43.510 --> 16:44.100
My Lord.

16:44.120 --> 16:44.640
My Lord.

16:45.080 --> 16:45.880
My Lord.

16:46.370 --> 16:47.570
-My Lord.
-Xiao Ming.

16:50.950 --> 16:52.950
You've got your power back, My Lord?

16:54.250 --> 16:55.960
His Lordship has restored his power!

16:55.960 --> 16:56.440
Really?

16:56.440 --> 16:57.270
That's great!

16:57.270 --> 16:58.230
Sorry,

16:58.370 --> 17:00.030
everyone, I've come too late.

17:06.310 --> 17:09.170
Thank you
for your tremendous help, seniors.

17:09.190 --> 17:10.490
As expected of great senior demons.

17:10.490 --> 17:11.550
You can tell the difference

17:11.550 --> 17:12.960
when senior demons strike.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.270
You've truly opened our eyes.

17:14.270 --> 17:14.880
Xiao Yao,

17:15.349 --> 17:16.280
I told you before

17:16.690 --> 17:18.020
that even without Hong Ye,

17:18.020 --> 17:19.819
we could still repel the humans.

17:20.829 --> 17:21.349
Hong Ye,

17:21.880 --> 17:23.410
the humans have retreated.

17:23.640 --> 17:24.200
Now,

17:24.490 --> 17:26.180
it's time to settle our score.

17:28.069 --> 17:29.870
Regardless of our past grudges,

17:30.150 --> 17:31.810
I, Hong Ye, really appreciate

17:32.150 --> 17:33.410
your tremendous help.

17:40.610 --> 17:41.160
Xiao Ming.

17:41.160 --> 17:41.590
Yes.

17:41.940 --> 17:43.200
Take everyone back to Youning Cave.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.400
I need to discuss important matters

17:44.400 --> 17:45.260
with these 3 seniors.

17:45.260 --> 17:45.830
But...

17:46.370 --> 17:47.400
Follow my order.

17:48.510 --> 17:49.220
Yes.

17:50.200 --> 17:52.240
Everyone, follow me back to Youning Cave!

17:52.240 --> 17:52.850
Let's go.

17:52.870 --> 17:54.200
Come on, let me help you.

18:01.840 --> 18:02.770
I'm not leaving.

18:03.550 --> 18:04.220
Xiao Yao.

18:04.920 --> 18:05.580
Step aside.

18:06.480 --> 18:07.740
This is between Hong Ye

18:08.120 --> 18:09.550
and the 3 of us.

18:10.510 --> 18:11.040
Xiao Yao,

18:11.710 --> 18:12.540
he's right.

18:12.590 --> 18:15.000
Though I don't know
what happened in the past,

18:15.000 --> 18:15.780
today,

18:16.640 --> 18:18.500
I must settle things with these 3.

18:22.510 --> 18:23.170
Let me do it.

18:23.880 --> 18:24.460
You!

18:30.070 --> 18:30.920
What are you looking at?

18:30.920 --> 18:32.110
I'm talking to you.

18:32.350 --> 18:33.080
What did I do?

18:33.200 --> 18:35.400
I won't talk
about past grievances for now.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.550
You just held me hostage,

18:36.550 --> 18:37.640
nearly ruining my reputation.

18:37.640 --> 18:39.900
How do we settle this immediate offense?

18:41.030 --> 18:42.380
When did I ever hold you hostage?

18:42.380 --> 18:44.110
You took advantage of the chaos,

18:44.110 --> 18:46.400
and your methods weren't
any better than humans'.

18:46.400 --> 18:48.750
You weren't really trying
to ruin my sister's reputation, were you?

18:48.750 --> 18:49.430
Nonsense!

18:49.720 --> 18:50.790
I was afraid you two would hurt her.

18:50.790 --> 18:51.510
That's right.

18:51.510 --> 18:52.590
You almost hurt her.

18:52.590 --> 18:53.790
When did I ever hurt her?

18:53.790 --> 18:54.320
He's mad,

18:54.550 --> 18:55.110
getting defensive!

18:55.110 --> 18:56.110
Why so mad?

18:56.110 --> 18:56.960
Who's mad?

18:56.980 --> 18:58.380
And you two...

18:58.920 --> 18:59.490
Sister,

18:59.640 --> 19:01.420
I always listen to you.

19:01.640 --> 19:02.160
Me, too...

19:02.160 --> 19:02.790
Shut up.

19:05.680 --> 19:07.080
What did you just call me?

19:07.480 --> 19:08.540
Sister, of course.

19:09.020 --> 19:10.490
I've missed you so much.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.530
Shameless.

19:17.690 --> 19:19.270
Since you call me sister,

19:19.550 --> 19:21.400
why are you irritating me here

19:21.400 --> 19:22.530
just like these two?

19:25.240 --> 19:27.040
There's indeed something wrong

19:27.110 --> 19:28.000
with you two.

19:45.070 --> 19:45.930
Hong Ye!

19:47.680 --> 19:49.800
How dare you hide behind Xiao Yao?

19:50.440 --> 19:52.350
Today, I challenge you
to a fight to the death.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.550
Do you dare accept it?

19:53.640 --> 19:54.480
I'll say yes.

19:55.070 --> 19:56.660
I challenge you to a fight.

19:57.110 --> 19:58.310
Do you dare accept it?

19:58.840 --> 19:59.300
Come on.

19:59.480 --> 20:00.480
Fight me first.

20:00.750 --> 20:02.350
Then you can go fight Hong Ye.

20:04.540 --> 20:05.140
Well...

20:06.270 --> 20:07.160
"Well"?

20:07.180 --> 20:08.110
Are you dumb?

20:11.400 --> 20:11.910
What?

20:12.070 --> 20:12.590
Are you scared?

20:12.590 --> 20:12.990
Why...

20:13.680 --> 20:14.440
Why wouldn't I be scared?

20:14.440 --> 20:15.840
So, will you fight or not?

20:22.270 --> 20:24.310
I was just released
from a 10,000-year seal.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.190
My body is

20:25.310 --> 20:25.790
weak.

20:26.510 --> 20:28.570
Let me recover first before we fight.

20:29.070 --> 20:29.930
What do you say?

20:31.030 --> 20:31.750
Fine!

20:35.200 --> 20:36.330
What about you then?

20:36.640 --> 20:38.100
Need some time to recover?

20:43.700 --> 20:45.710
Our Demons' Valley has been destroyed.

20:45.710 --> 20:47.150
We need to rebuild our home.

20:47.150 --> 20:48.600
There are a whole lot of things
to attend to.

20:48.600 --> 20:50.330
So we'll have to take our leave.

20:51.210 --> 20:51.830
Let's go.

20:56.240 --> 20:56.710
Xiao...

21:02.790 --> 21:03.200
To...

21:03.530 --> 21:04.470
To kill Hong Ye,

21:04.830 --> 21:06.430
we must first fight Xiao Yao.

21:06.920 --> 21:08.120
Isn't it unsolvable?

21:09.160 --> 21:10.790
The Qiong Qi Clan has robust limbs

21:10.790 --> 21:11.790
but simple minds.

21:12.090 --> 21:14.020
The reputation is well-deserved.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.380
Enough!

21:19.640 --> 21:20.900
You still don't get it?

21:21.030 --> 21:22.240
Even without her memory,

21:22.240 --> 21:23.510
Sister is still protecting Hong Ye.

21:23.510 --> 21:24.240
That means

21:24.750 --> 21:26.010
even if we kill Hong Ye,

21:26.640 --> 21:28.270
Sister will only resent us.

21:29.030 --> 21:30.890
We need to figure out another way.

21:31.310 --> 21:32.720
What's most frustrating now is

21:32.720 --> 21:35.250
that even Hong Ye
doesn't remember anything.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.480
Even if I kill him,

21:37.270 --> 21:39.600
it still won't
ease the hatred in my heart!

21:44.960 --> 21:47.430
How did those 3 show up
out of nowhere again?

21:47.770 --> 21:49.690
These 3 great demons are powerful

21:50.350 --> 21:51.750
and harbor intense resentment

21:51.750 --> 21:53.480
toward both humans and demons.

21:53.590 --> 21:55.920
They were sealed in Yunmeng Lake years ago

21:56.030 --> 21:58.400
for fear that they would bring disaster
to the world.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.400
But this matter is

21:59.430 --> 22:00.890
a secret of the demon race,

22:01.050 --> 22:03.180
known only to successive Demon Kings.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.640
Yet somehow Heiwu

22:04.880 --> 22:06.360
learned about this secret

22:06.920 --> 22:08.260
and broke their seal.

22:12.510 --> 22:14.910
They actually are quite adorable, though.

22:14.920 --> 22:17.050
Who knows if they're just pretending?

22:21.700 --> 22:24.010
Why are they so hostile toward you?

22:27.880 --> 22:29.140
I wonder what grudges

22:29.750 --> 22:31.210
existed 10,000 years ago.

22:31.840 --> 22:33.970
So we knew each other 10,000 years ago.

22:34.640 --> 22:35.660
I'm so curious

22:35.690 --> 22:37.890
about how we first met 10,000 years ago.

22:44.200 --> 22:45.260
Exalted Immortal.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.650
We've heard that you consume wind and dew

22:48.650 --> 22:50.620
and gather the essence of flowers.

22:50.920 --> 22:53.110
So we have prepared
these humble offerings,

22:53.110 --> 22:54.950
hoping they might

22:55.720 --> 22:57.680
please you, Exalted Immortal.

23:10.700 --> 23:12.300
You dare speak of sincerity?

23:14.830 --> 23:16.890
I guess it was your unsatisfied greed

23:17.130 --> 23:19.060
that caused you this retribution!

23:21.160 --> 23:22.220
Exalted Immortal,

23:22.510 --> 23:24.010
why do you say so?

23:25.110 --> 23:27.510
The Emperor trusted shameless sorcerers,

23:27.830 --> 23:29.100
misused pills,

23:29.880 --> 23:31.740
and consumed way too many demons,

23:31.780 --> 23:34.310
leading to the emergence
of the ancient great demons

23:34.310 --> 23:35.640
who had been sealed for 10,000 years.

23:35.640 --> 23:37.550
How could humans stand a chance to win?

23:37.550 --> 23:37.970
Well...

23:37.970 --> 23:39.240
How could this happen?

23:39.920 --> 23:41.400
Please calm down, Exalted Immortal.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.400
I'm going to petition His Majesty

23:43.400 --> 23:44.710
to send reinforcements immediately.

23:44.710 --> 23:46.250
All hell broke loose.

23:47.200 --> 23:49.130
No matter how many troops you send,

23:50.370 --> 23:53.050
they won't satisfy
the demons' bloodthirst.

23:55.070 --> 23:58.140
Please save us, Exalted Immortal!

24:09.630 --> 24:10.660
Is there

24:11.920 --> 24:13.530
a Mountain and Sea Map

24:14.110 --> 24:16.770
drawn by ancient demons
in the imperial palace?

24:20.110 --> 24:21.960
Go check
the imperial treasury immediately.

24:21.960 --> 24:22.710
If it's there,

24:22.710 --> 24:25.310
bring it
to the Exalted Immortal immediately!

24:25.990 --> 24:26.710
Hurry!

24:27.400 --> 24:28.060
-Yes.
-Yes.

24:28.390 --> 24:29.190
Hurry up!

24:32.240 --> 24:32.740
Get up.

24:33.070 --> 24:33.670
Leave now.

25:30.660 --> 25:31.920
Dreamshard Immortal,

25:34.030 --> 25:36.030
I ended up becoming you.

25:41.610 --> 25:42.090
No!

25:44.100 --> 25:44.900
I am not you.

25:47.160 --> 25:48.640
I will never become you!

26:03.510 --> 26:04.510
You may all leave.

26:06.830 --> 26:07.490
-Yes.
-Yes.

26:25.240 --> 26:28.290
[Misty Forest] [Mount Qingyuan]
[Mount Qingyun] [Pingjiang Prefecture]

26:28.310 --> 26:32.300
[Hong Ye] [Qiong Qi] [Ao Hen] [Teng She]

26:35.150 --> 26:37.600
[Hong Ye] [Qiong Qi] [Ao Hen] [Teng She]

26:37.400 --> 26:39.000
There are actually 3 of them.

26:41.510 --> 26:42.720
No wonder we lost.

26:54.390 --> 26:56.220
We were originally prepared
to deal with Hong Ye alone,

26:56.220 --> 26:57.630
but now there are 3 more.

26:58.840 --> 27:00.870
Each of them is
even more powerful than Hong Ye.

27:00.870 --> 27:02.530
How can we continue fighting?

27:03.010 --> 27:05.070
The Bulwark Duke is working on a plan.

27:05.480 --> 27:06.200
We just

27:06.750 --> 27:07.880
need to follow orders.

27:07.880 --> 27:08.310
Mm.

27:14.920 --> 27:15.350
Sir,

27:15.930 --> 27:17.480
we've lost everything we had.

27:17.480 --> 27:19.540
What plan could we possibly work out?

27:22.240 --> 27:24.170
Let's count our casualties first.

27:24.590 --> 27:25.000
Yes.

27:34.140 --> 27:35.140
You bold demon!

27:35.440 --> 27:37.700
How dare you sneak into our camp at night?

27:41.160 --> 27:42.960
Why so nervous, Mr. Ji?

27:44.440 --> 27:46.240
You and I are now of the same kind.

27:47.160 --> 27:49.990
Why should I hold past grudges
against you?

27:52.590 --> 27:54.190
What happened before wasn't

27:55.000 --> 27:57.070
solely your responsibility.

27:58.590 --> 28:00.270
I was foolish,

28:01.440 --> 28:03.720
choosing someone whose word meant nothing

28:03.720 --> 28:05.590
to join me for the great cause!

28:13.560 --> 28:15.650
If you go back now,

28:16.790 --> 28:18.920
humans will surely despise you.

28:20.100 --> 28:21.580
If I'm not mistaken,

28:22.270 --> 28:24.730
you won't even be allowed
to survive, right?

28:25.240 --> 28:28.110
And since Demons' Valley
cannot be conquered at the moment,

28:28.110 --> 28:31.140
you're truly caught
between a rock and a hard place.

28:34.720 --> 28:37.110
But we're in the same situation.

28:38.400 --> 28:40.460
Neither humans nor demons accept us.

28:40.790 --> 28:42.680
Only by joining forces

28:43.910 --> 28:46.060
can we gain freedom of movement.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.240
You need me.

28:49.880 --> 28:52.190
Because I know demons the best.

28:54.070 --> 28:55.530
Come into the tent to talk.

29:12.160 --> 29:12.640
My Lord,

29:13.110 --> 29:14.240
Heiwu was previously

29:14.240 --> 29:15.350
my informant

29:15.350 --> 29:16.960
planted among the demons.

29:18.590 --> 29:19.390
Informant?

29:21.400 --> 29:22.420
Is he an informant

29:22.680 --> 29:24.000
or just a loser?

29:26.240 --> 29:28.770
I've offended you a lot before,
Bulwark Duke.

29:29.030 --> 29:30.630
I'd like to apologize for it.

29:31.000 --> 29:31.790
Hope you

29:33.070 --> 29:34.600
can let it go, Bulwark Duke.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.300
This defeat

29:38.880 --> 29:40.680
has caused humans heavy losses.

29:41.350 --> 29:43.270
Aren't you curious, Bulwark Duke,

29:43.270 --> 29:46.400
about the 3 great demons
that suddenly appeared in Demons' Valley

29:46.400 --> 29:47.830
and their origins?

29:54.480 --> 29:55.340
There used to be

29:55.590 --> 29:57.450
a Sea Turtle guarding this place,

29:57.590 --> 29:59.120
so the seal never weakened.

30:00.440 --> 30:02.900
To release
those 3 ancient fierce beasts,

30:03.710 --> 30:05.510
Hong Ye used any means necessary

30:06.030 --> 30:08.890
and cruelly murdered
the only Demon Lord Sea Turtle

30:09.200 --> 30:10.370
of our demons.

30:14.680 --> 30:16.210
Sea Turtle above in heaven,

30:17.110 --> 30:18.480
I, Heiwu,

30:19.000 --> 30:20.870
will surely avenge your death!

30:29.590 --> 30:30.720
Those 3 great demons

30:31.920 --> 30:33.880
in yesterday's battle all have power

30:33.880 --> 30:35.240
greater than Hong Ye's.

30:36.880 --> 30:38.800
Even if Hong Ye removed the seal

30:39.000 --> 30:40.730
to bring disaster to the world,

30:41.680 --> 30:42.480
how could he possibly

30:42.480 --> 30:45.140
control 3 ancient fierce beasts
at the same time

30:45.390 --> 30:46.460
to work for him?

30:49.270 --> 30:50.480
Xiao Yao.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.080
Xiao Yao?

30:54.350 --> 30:56.210
I saw it with my own eyes yesterday

30:56.510 --> 30:59.030
that those 3 great demons were all
devoted to Xiao Yao.

30:59.030 --> 31:00.540
Xiao Yao said a few words,

31:00.750 --> 31:01.960
yet they took them as gospel

31:01.960 --> 31:03.290
and obeyed completely.

31:03.510 --> 31:04.160
I guess

31:04.680 --> 31:06.470
Hong Ye exploited this

31:06.720 --> 31:07.790
to trick them

31:08.620 --> 31:09.970
into fighting for him.

31:20.660 --> 31:23.480
When Tan'er fought those 3 great demons,

31:24.030 --> 31:26.000
I could sense their power, too.

31:27.000 --> 31:29.200
They truly boast tremendous strength.

31:29.240 --> 31:31.970
With these 3 ancient great demons
joining the demon side,

31:31.970 --> 31:34.300
humans are now greatly outmatched.

31:34.510 --> 31:36.770
You cannot hope to win by strength alone.

31:37.890 --> 31:39.530
You must find their weakness

31:40.730 --> 31:42.190
and defeat them one by one.

31:42.270 --> 31:44.550
Heiwu's selfish intentions are obvious.

31:44.550 --> 31:47.350
He simply wants to use human power
for his own ends.

31:47.830 --> 31:49.560
Be it humans or demons,

31:50.440 --> 31:52.170
everyone has selfish motives.

31:52.570 --> 31:54.570
Since you know his true intentions,

31:55.580 --> 31:56.640
you should realize

31:57.550 --> 31:58.950
that what he says is true.

31:59.440 --> 32:01.300
The 3 ancient great demons

32:01.870 --> 32:03.080
plus Hong Ye.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.030
They've got

32:08.360 --> 32:09.660
only one weakness.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.770
What on earth happened?

32:34.480 --> 32:35.500
Exalted Immortal,

32:35.500 --> 32:36.430
are you alright?

32:42.350 --> 32:43.400
Blood essence...

32:45.080 --> 32:46.420
Spiritual essence...

32:59.200 --> 33:00.260
Exalted Immortal,

33:00.500 --> 33:01.300
drink this.

33:12.590 --> 33:14.090
Get lost now.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.640
Yes.

33:24.430 --> 33:25.430
Immortal Lord...

33:28.440 --> 33:30.400
I will never become you.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.790
Never!

33:38.840 --> 33:39.640
Bulwark Duke.

33:39.950 --> 33:41.110
What happened, Bulwark Duke?

33:41.110 --> 33:42.680
There's an emergency happening
in the capital.

33:42.680 --> 33:44.000
I must hurry back immediately.

33:44.000 --> 33:44.720
Bulwark Duke,

33:44.720 --> 33:45.590
you can't do it.

33:45.680 --> 33:47.240
The war
between the 2 clans is ever-changing.

33:47.240 --> 33:48.440
Any delay could lead to disaster.

33:48.440 --> 33:50.370
I said I must return to the capital!

34:04.640 --> 34:06.050
What on earth happened?

34:06.240 --> 34:07.270
Are you hurt?

34:08.030 --> 34:08.960
I'm fine.

34:10.150 --> 34:11.350
The war is important.

34:12.070 --> 34:13.360
Do not be distracted.

34:14.880 --> 34:16.630
You're alone in the capital.

34:16.630 --> 34:18.190
Everyone is keeping an eye on you.

34:18.190 --> 34:19.489
How can I not worry?

34:20.710 --> 34:23.370
I am the Exalted Immortal
in the Emperor's eyes.

34:24.030 --> 34:25.710
Who would dare harm me?

34:27.060 --> 34:28.389
Even if I die,

34:30.030 --> 34:32.590
I will never consume
other people's essence

34:33.400 --> 34:36.000
or do things
that would make you look down on me.

34:39.840 --> 34:41.440
Everything will be fine

34:43.670 --> 34:45.230
once I find the Yuli Spring.

34:49.400 --> 34:50.920
It's just that lately,

34:53.760 --> 34:55.070
I often feel...

34:57.660 --> 35:00.320
I feel
that Dreamshard Immortal is still alive.

35:01.230 --> 35:02.980
She's in my body,

35:03.230 --> 35:04.710
trying to consume me,

35:06.440 --> 35:07.690
to enslave me,

35:09.690 --> 35:11.810
until she completely devours me.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.000
Bingzhu,

35:15.150 --> 35:16.150
do you remember

35:18.110 --> 35:20.000
when you first met me?

35:21.490 --> 35:22.960
As if it were yesterday.

35:25.710 --> 35:26.750
Great.

35:30.180 --> 35:31.390
I thought

35:35.370 --> 35:37.890
it had been
hundreds or thousands of years.

35:39.280 --> 35:41.810
Because even I
can barely remember it myself.

35:44.230 --> 35:46.280
This is all my fault.

35:46.880 --> 35:49.810
Everything I've done wasn't
to make you feel guilty.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.710
I know.

35:56.630 --> 35:57.670
You once said...

36:00.760 --> 36:02.960
You would take care of me for my brother.

36:05.320 --> 36:06.580
Does that still stand?

36:09.110 --> 36:10.190
Yes, of course.

36:13.800 --> 36:16.320
If you help me fulfill 3 more wishes,

36:18.920 --> 36:20.050
that will be enough.

36:23.070 --> 36:23.710
Okay.

36:25.480 --> 36:26.070
Go ahead.

36:27.960 --> 36:29.960
You said that you raised Tan'er.

36:31.280 --> 36:33.880
When she was little,
you couldn't afford toys,

36:33.930 --> 36:35.550
so you used your knife

36:36.240 --> 36:38.830
to carve wooden and bamboo dolls

36:39.670 --> 36:40.920
to make her happy

36:41.800 --> 36:43.000
and help her sleep.

36:46.440 --> 36:47.400
Could you...

36:50.190 --> 36:51.670
carve one for me, too?

36:54.510 --> 36:55.320
Of course.

36:57.480 --> 36:59.680
What kind of wooden doll would you like?

37:04.230 --> 37:05.230
Just make one

37:08.590 --> 37:10.030
that looks like me

37:13.500 --> 37:14.790
when we first met.

37:16.260 --> 37:17.590
Do you still remember?

37:19.690 --> 37:21.000
Of course I do.

37:23.950 --> 37:25.750
And what about your second wish?

37:27.250 --> 37:28.080
What's it?

37:31.440 --> 37:31.960
I...

37:32.110 --> 37:33.710
I can't think of it right now.

37:35.880 --> 37:37.760
When I think of something,

37:39.420 --> 37:40.670
I'll let you know.

37:58.920 --> 37:59.760
Orioles,

38:00.760 --> 38:01.550
Parrot,

38:02.590 --> 38:04.800
I can't bring you back to life,

38:05.970 --> 38:07.550
but together, we can

38:07.880 --> 38:09.590
save these dying flowers.

38:18.360 --> 38:20.690
You're quite good at deceiving yourself.

38:22.790 --> 38:24.050
Why are you still here?

38:25.310 --> 38:27.040
I just won a battle for you guys,

38:27.340 --> 38:29.070
and now you want to cut me loose?

38:33.370 --> 38:35.170
If these birds were still alive,

38:35.490 --> 38:37.290
would they agree to what you did?

38:37.730 --> 38:39.510
You turned their original bodies

38:39.510 --> 38:41.050
into rotten fertilizers

38:41.360 --> 38:42.960
to nourish a useless flower.

38:44.550 --> 38:46.400
All things in the world are one.

38:46.510 --> 38:47.480
As one wanes, another waxes.

38:47.480 --> 38:48.400
They nourish each other

38:48.400 --> 38:49.660
to achieve longevity.

38:49.710 --> 38:51.110
This is the law of nature.

38:51.150 --> 38:53.280
How can you call it rotten and useless?

38:53.590 --> 38:55.320
What a fine talk of wane and wax.

38:56.230 --> 38:57.710
Then, if Hong Ye's death

38:58.000 --> 38:59.840
could bring prosperity to demons,

38:59.840 --> 39:00.710
would you do it?

39:03.320 --> 39:04.520
Only with Hong Ye here

39:04.550 --> 39:05.760
will demons prosper.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.680
Were it not for Hong Ye,

39:09.150 --> 39:11.480
humans would have already been wiped out.

39:11.510 --> 39:12.230
And demons

39:12.840 --> 39:14.970
wouldn't be in such a miserable state.

39:16.400 --> 39:18.400
I'm afraid Hong Ye has never told you

39:18.710 --> 39:20.710
how he became the Demon King, right?

39:22.670 --> 39:23.670
Does that matter?

39:24.250 --> 39:26.000
You don't need to sow discord here.

39:26.000 --> 39:27.230
He's entirely devoted
to protecting demons,

39:27.230 --> 39:29.230
exhausting himself for their sake.

39:29.480 --> 39:30.340
That's enough.

39:31.630 --> 39:32.760
You don't remember,

39:34.960 --> 39:36.620
so it doesn't matter anymore?

39:47.230 --> 39:47.890
Never mind.

39:48.800 --> 39:50.460
I've waited for 10,000 years.

39:50.920 --> 39:53.120
A few more days won't make a difference.

39:54.480 --> 39:55.940
But you'd better remember

39:56.680 --> 39:58.740
that I, Ao Hen, always get my revenge.

39:59.480 --> 40:01.010
You can protect him for now,

40:01.960 --> 40:03.070
but not forever.

40:14.000 --> 40:14.670
Sister!

40:15.360 --> 40:15.960
Sister,

40:16.150 --> 40:16.630
look!

40:16.960 --> 40:18.220
See what I brought you.

40:20.400 --> 40:22.860
Why did you bring
the Zhuyu herbs' home here?

40:23.030 --> 40:25.550
I thought
these little things were quite cute,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.630
and you might like...

40:26.630 --> 40:27.360
Put it back!

40:30.510 --> 40:32.030
That's what you get
for flattering her recklessly!

40:32.030 --> 40:33.360
You irritated her, huh?

40:39.230 --> 40:40.000
Alright, alright.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.480
I'm not really mad.

40:41.480 --> 40:42.800
You're actually quite adorable.

40:42.800 --> 40:43.480
Much better than

40:43.480 --> 40:45.150
that sarcastic Ao Hen.

40:45.880 --> 40:46.440
Xiao Yao,

40:46.880 --> 40:48.540
has Ao Hen provoked you again?

40:49.440 --> 40:50.400
No, no, no.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.000
Well,

40:51.510 --> 40:53.190
it's because of my weak power.

40:53.230 --> 40:54.800
It has nothing to do with the senior.

40:54.800 --> 40:55.670
It doesn't matter.

40:55.670 --> 40:56.800
As long as we're here,

40:56.800 --> 40:58.400
you're still the strongest in this world.

40:58.400 --> 40:58.880
Mm.

41:00.400 --> 41:01.590
I appreciate your kindness,

41:01.590 --> 41:04.120
but I think it's better
to cultivate on my own.

41:05.280 --> 41:06.030
Well, then,

41:06.400 --> 41:07.920
let me teach you, Sister.

41:09.480 --> 41:10.110
Um,

41:10.590 --> 41:12.850
could you please stop calling me Sister?

41:14.150 --> 41:15.400
You said it for real?

41:15.670 --> 41:16.280
So,

41:16.360 --> 41:17.820
if I don't call you Sister,

41:17.880 --> 41:18.880
does that mean...

41:18.880 --> 41:20.630
Does that mean I can like you now?

41:20.630 --> 41:21.670
What nonsense are you talking about?
